.KEY demo/A
.BRA {
.KET }
; RunCensus -- GLQuake against the census minigl.library (DEV:Libs/Census,
; added to LIBS: for this run only): timedemo {demo}, then -timedemoquit
; ends the program so the library writes its slot totals. Output:
; DEV:Test/census-{demo}.csv + census-{demo}-slots.csv, GLQuake's own text
; in DEV:Test/census-{demo}.log, a done marker when it is over.
; -anycpu: FS-UAE's machine is a 68040 and GLQuake the 68060 build, which
; refuses another CPU since 2026-11-06 (it ran there emulating FINTRZ before).
FailAt 1000
CD DEV:Quake
SetEnv MiniGLCensus DEV:Test/census-{demo}
Assign LIBS: DEV:Libs/Census ADD
GLQuake -anycpu -stdout -nosound -nocdaudio -noudp -nolan -timedemoquit +timedemo {demo} >DEV:Test/census-{demo}.log
Echo "census {demo} rc=$RC" >>DEV:Test/census-{demo}.log
Assign LIBS: DEV:Libs/Census REMOVE
UnSetEnv MiniGLCensus
Echo >DEV:Test/census-{demo}.done done
